Third-party components
----------------------

Vey's default English semantic encoder is
`mixedbread-ai/mxbai-embed-xsmall-v1`, a separate work by the Mixedbread AI
authors, redistributed via the Hugging Face hub and licensed under the
Apache License 2.0. Copyright and attribution remain with the upstream authors.
Vey does not modify or retrain the encoder; Vey trains only small heads and
selectors on top of frozen representations.

The Apache License 2.0 text is available at:
  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

No model weights are committed to this repository. Installation fetches the
pinned encoder from the Hugging Face hub at run time.
